          "0x04 [DTC 3] [record]": "snapshot records of a DTC (1..16 the n-th newest, 0xFF all) -> 59 04 [DTC 3] [status] ([record] 01 FD 2F [49 bytes nv_fault_t])*",
          "0x0A": "supported DTCs -> 59 0A 7F ([DTC 3] [status])*"
